+---
+id: dl-001-keep-vat-on-shipping-despite-customer-request
+type: decision-log
+title: "Keep VAT on shipping despite customer request"
+status: pending
+---
+
+## Context
+
+A customer (Anna) asked that no VAT be added to delivery costs, as delivery is a service. The README
+states: "Shipping is subject to VAT at the standard rate (22%), shown on its own line of the receipt",
+and the order total includes VAT on shipping. Following the request would change a documented business
+rule (and tax treatment), which a customer report alone cannot decide.
+
+## Decision
+
+Leave shipping VAT unchanged for now. If the business wants to change the rule, the README, `tax.ts`
+and `pricing.ts` must change together, after a decision by the approver.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Receipts keep showing VAT on shipping (€1.08 on €4.90). No code change for this report.
