@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+---
+id: task-002-fix-coupon-base-coupon-last-day-shipping-vat-request
+type: task
+title: "Fix coupon base, coupon last day; shipping VAT request"
+status: pending
+---
+
+## What was done
+
+1. Percentage coupons were computed on the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume discounts
+   (README, Discounts). `priceOrder` now passes the after-volume subtotal to `couponDiscount`.
+   12 notebooks at €5.00 with a 10% coupon now give €48.60 of goods.
+2. A coupon was refused on its last day (`>=`); the README says both days are included. `redeemable` now uses `>`.
+3. Not changed: the request to drop VAT on shipping contradicts the README (shipping is subject to VAT at 22%,
+   and the README is right when it disagrees with the code). See dl-001; it waits for approval.
+
+Tests added in `test/coupons.test.ts`; `npm test` passes (19/19).
